<title>HONG KONG: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Swire.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Swire.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International</p>
<p>said it was issuing 85 million American-style call warrants on</p>
<p>shares of Swire Pacific Ltd &quot;A&quot;.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$79.01	  PREMIUM	     16.39 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.85785	GEARING	     8.77X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  22.NOV.97	 LISTING DATE	19.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$75.25</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
